            "review_title": "Review at Than Hồng Bbq",
            "review_text": "Anh Vũ T\nDa Nang, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nDelicious Vietnamese charcoal BBQ — great lunch for our group of four\nJul 2025 • Friends\nWe were four travelers looking for a tasty, unpretentious lunch and Than Hồng BBQ delivered. Charcoal grills at the table give everything a wonderful smokiness, yet the room is cool with strong ventilation. Meats are marinated Vietnamese‑style and nicely balanced; our favorites were the bulgogi short ribs, beef hump in house sauce, pork belly, and oysters (both scallion oil and cheese). Don’t miss the local touches like bánh tráng cuốn thịt heo and gỏi cá Nam Ô; salmon sashimi was fresh, too. Service was warm and efficient—staff changed grills often and advised on cooking times. Clean space, cozy wooden décor, fair prices. We’d happily come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 27, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
