            "review_text": "Thu Hà Nguyễn\nDa Nang, Vietnam23 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely delicious! A must-try BBQ in Da Nang\nJul 2025 • Friends\nWe came here for dinner and it was such a memorable experience. The grilled beef was incredibly tender, the seafood fresh, and the marinated flavors were spot-on. The interior had a cozy, traditional Vietnamese touch with wooden décor and murals that made the vibe perfect for a relaxing night. Service was quick and friendly, and they even offered help in English. We especially loved the charcoal grill at the table—super authentic! Highly recommend for families, couples, or travelers looking for a taste of local BBQ with great quality. Will definitely come back!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTry the marinated beef hump and grilled oysters — flavorful and unique! Best to reserve in advance during weekends.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 27, 2025",
