            "review_text": "Jenny\n11 contributions\n0\nThan Hồng BBQ was one of the most impressive dining spots for our whole family.\nJul 2025 • Family\nOur family just had a wonderful trip to Da Nang – a beautiful coastal city with friendly people and absolutely amazing food! Among all the places we visited, Than Hồng BBQ was one of the most impressive dining spots for our whole family.\n\n🔸 The space is cozy and clean, perfect for both big groups and families with elders or small kids like ours.\n🔸 The staff were friendly, helpful, and attentive from the moment we booked the table until we left.\n🔸 And most importantly: the food was absolutely delicious – the meat was well-marinated and grilled to perfection. We especially loved the pork belly wrapped with kimchi and the spicy Korean chicken – everyone in the family kept complimenting the flavors! The hotpot at the end was also fantastic, with a naturally sweet broth and generous toppings.\n\nWhat I really appreciated was how the restaurant paid attention to small details – from the clean utensils to the beautifully presented dishes. You could truly feel that they care about providing a great experience for their guests – and we were completely satisfied!\n\n👉 If you’re visiting Da Nang and looking for a place that serves great food, is clean, and offers excellent service, I wholeheartedly recommend trying Than Hồng BBQ.\nIt wasn’t just a meal – it became a memorable part of our trip. ❤️\nRead more\nWritten July 27, 2025",
